# RollON — Premium Smoking Accessories Storefront

## Environment Variables

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in your values:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

### Required Variables

| Variable | Description | Default |
|----------|-------------|---------|
| `VITE_API_BASE_URL` | API base URL | `/api` |
| `VITE_CURRENCY` | Currency code | `BDT` |
| `VITE_CURRENCY_SYMBOL` | Currency symbol | `৳` |
| `VITE_LOCALE` | Locale | `bn-BD` |

### Optional Variables

| Variable | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `VITE_SENTRY_DSN` | Sentry error tracking DSN |
| `VITE_POSTHOG_KEY` | PostHog analytics key |
| `VITE_SSLCOMMERZ_STORE_ID` | SSLCommerz payment gateway ID |
| `VITE_BKASH_APP_KEY` | bKash merchant API key |

> **Security Note:** Never commit `.env` files to version control. The `.gitignore` file excludes all `.env` files by default.